## Non-matching: backslash stays

| Source | Expected (literal both chars) | Live |
|---|---|---|
| `\A` | `\A` | \A |
| `\a` | `\a` | \a |
| `\1` | `\1` | \1 |
| `\ ` (backslash space) | `\ ` | \ |

## Interaction: marker doesn't fire

| Source | Expected | Live |
|---|---|---|
| `\*not italic\*` | `*not italic*` (no `<em>` wrap) | \*not italic\* |
| `\_not underscore\_` | `_not underscore_` | \_not underscore\_ |
| `` \`not code\` `` | `` `not code` `` (no `<code>`) | \`not code\` |
| `\[not a link\](url)` | `[not a link](url)` (no `<a>`) | \[not a link\](url) |

## Inside code span: escapes inert (body-raw)

| Source | Expected | Live |
|---|---|---|
| `` `\*literal\*` `` | `` `\*literal\*` `` (backslashes survive) | `\*literal\*` |
| `` `\\` `` | `` `\\` `` | `\\` |
